{"id":"task-worktree-isolation-merge-closure","display_id":null,"title":"Require merge or no-merge disposition before write task closure","description":"Add closure law and runtime gates so every write-producing task worktree ends in explicit merge or no-merge disposition. A task can close only when its worktree assignment reports merged into the target base, abandoned_no_changes, superseded_by another task, or blocked_manual_reconcile with a linked follow-up. Merge must protect main from stale base, dirty worktree, uncommitted changes, unresolved conflicts, missing proof receipts, and branch drift. Local merge and remote push expectations must be represented separately.","status":"open","priority":0,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"1779463824429786400","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779463824429786400","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":null,"labels":["closure","merge","proof","worktree"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"sequential","order_bucket":"worktree-isolation-runtime","parallel_group":"merge-closure","conflict_domain":"worktree-merge-closure"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":["crates/vida/src/diagnostics_surface.rs","crates/vida/src/doctor_surface.rs","crates/vida/src/task_surface.rs","vida/config/instructions/runtime-instructions/work.verification-merge-protocol.md"],"acceptance_targets":["No-change and superseded closure paths require explicit evidence","Task closure blocks active write assignments with pending merge status","worktree merge records receipt with base head proof refs and target commit"],"proof_targets":["Closure gate tests cover pending merge success no-change stale base and conflict blockers"],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"task-worktree-isolation-merge-closure","depends_on_id":"task-worktree-isolation-epic","edge_type":"parent-child","created_at":"1779463824429786400","created_by":"vida t