{"id":"task-worktree-isolation-product-spec","display_id":null,"title":"Write product spec for project-internal task worktree assignment model","description":"Create the canonical product spec for mandatory task-owned git worktrees inside the project root. The spec must define .vida/worktrees/<task-id> as the default local root because external paths may not be available. It must connect project id, state root id, worktree environment id, orchestrator session id, task id, run id, lane id, claim id, branch name, base ref, owned paths, conflict domain, and merge status. It must define which tasks require worktrees, which read-only tasks do not, how stale worktrees are reclaimed, how nested worktrees are ignored by repo hygiene, and how merge or no-merge closure is proven.","status":"open","priority":0,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"1779463729377844300","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779463729377844300","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":null,"labels":["architecture","claims","spec","worktree"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"sequential","order_bucket":"worktree-isolation-foundation","parallel_group":"product-spec","conflict_domain":"product-spec-worktree-isolation"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":["docs/product/spec/README.md","docs/product/spec/task-worktree-isolation-model.md"],"acceptance_targets":["Spec defines .vida/worktrees as default project internal worktree root","Spec defines merge outcomes cleanup rules and repo hygiene guard","Spec defines task_worktree_assignment schema and lifecycle states"],"proof_targets":["vida docflow check --root . docs/product/spec/task-worktree-isolation-model.md passes"],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"task-worktree-isolation-product-spec","depends_on_id":"task-worktree-isolation-epic","edge_type":"parent-child","created_at":"1779463729377844300","created_by":"vida task","met