{"id":"taskflow-defect-template-carrier-retry-admissibility","display_id":null,"title":"Retry packet carrier override bypasses template admissibility and budget fallback","description":"Observed 2026-05-18 in run runtime-vida-taskflow-codex: coach/review continuation packet selected an explicit retry carrier and then blocked with timeout_without_takeover_authority before terminal evidence. This must be tracked as a generic runtime defect, not a hardcoded Codex/Hermes/model special case. Expected invariant: retry/IDA/downstream packets resolve carriers through configured templates, carrier registry, admissibility matrix, budgets, and route fallback policy; stale or blocked explicit retry overrides must not bypass those unified constraints. If no admissible fallback exists, status must return an actionable blocker naming the missing template/admissibility/budget evidence, not loop on the same timed-out carrier. Evidence: packet .vida/data/state/runtime-consumption/dispatch-packets/runtime-vida-taskflow-codex-2026-05-18T05-26-43.2901505Z.json; result .vida/data/state/runtime-consumption/dispatch-results/runtime-vida-taskflow-codex-2026-05-18T05-27-08.659046Z.json; blocker timeout_without_takeover_authority; active node coach.","status":"closed","priority":0,"issue_type":"defect","created_at":"1779083052459538000","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779085510294796800","closed_at":"1779085510294796800","close_reason":"Fixed retry/template/admissibility routing: profile overlay writes canonical dispatch model/provider, blocked route-primary dispatch results become fallback-eligible, resume accepts retry-eligible blocked receipts, and timeout_without_takeover_authority now prefers configured route fallback before external fanout. Proof passed, release installed with hash parity C715644A0F798C06, and live continuation selected internal_subagents instead of external fanout. Remaining internal activation_view_only is split to taskflow-defect-internal-fallback-activation-view-only-regression.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"2026-05-18 closure evidence for retry/template/admissibility defect:\n- Read-only vida_mobile evidence: configured owner registry model_profiles resolve model_ref gpt-5.4 while rendered legacy Codex CLI template carried stale gpt-5.5; classified as generic template/registry/materialization drift, not model/tool-specific behavior.\n- Code fixes shipped in bounded paths: runtime_dispatch_execution applies selected internal profile overlay to canonical dispatch model/model_provider; runtime_dispatch_state treats prior blocked route-primary dispatch results as fallback-eligible; taskflow_consume_resume allows retry-eligible blocked agent receipts through resume validation and prefers configured route fallback after timeout_without_takeover_authority before external fanout.\n- Proof: cargo fmt -p vida --check; cargo test -p vida selected_internal_host_carrier_applies_internal_subagent_route_profile_overlay -- --nocapture; cargo test -p vida blocked_primary_dispatch_result_prefers_route_fallback_on_retry -- --nocapture; cargo test -p vida validate_run_graph_resume_state_accepts_retry_eligible_blocked_agent_receipt -- --nocapture; cargo test -p vida retry_backend_prefers_route_fallback_after_handoff_timeout -- --nocapture; cargo test -p vida retry_backend_uses_distinct_review_fanout_before_fallback_for_non_timeout_blocker -- --nocapture.\n- Release: cargo build -p vida --release passed; target\\release\\vida.exe release install --json passed; environment-resolved vida C:\\Users\\pomaz\\AppData\\Local\\vida-stack\\current\\bin\\vida.exe hash matched target release hash C715644A0F798C06.\n- Live continuation proof: vida taskflow consume continue --run-id runtime-vida-taskflow-codex --json no longer selected external opencode/hermes fanout after timeout; lane status selected_backend=internal_subagents. This proves the current retry/fallback ordering defect is fixed.\