{"id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-adapter-binary","display_id":null,"title":"Adapter: vida-pi-agent Rust binary and RPC/result normalization","description":"Implement vida-pi-agent as VIDA-owned Rust workspace binary. One Pi process per dispatch, prefer pi --mode rpc, set model/thinking, prompt once, wait for agent_end, emit VIDA-compatible type=result JSON.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"delivery_task","created_at":"1779203966544252500","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779207266825802800","closed_at":"1779207266825802800","close_reason":"vida-pi-agent adapter crate implemented and tests passed","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"Implemented `vida-pi-agent` adapter binary slice.\n\nChanged files in approved scope:\n- Cargo.toml: added workspace member `crates/vida-pi-agent`.\n- crates/vida-pi-agent/Cargo.toml\n- crates/vida-pi-agent/src/lib.rs\n- crates/vida-pi-agent/src/main.rs\n- crates/vida-pi-agent/src/bin/fake_pi.rs\n- crates/vida-pi-agent/tests/adapter.rs\n\nCLI contract:\n- Supports `--mode rpc` (default), `--model`, `--thinking-level`, `--workdir`, `--pi-command`, `--timeout-seconds`, prompt via stdin or positional args.\n- Accepts/pass-through safe Pi flags: `--no-session`, `--no-context-files`, `--no-skills`, `--no-extensions`, `--no-prompt-templates`, `--no-tools`.\n- Spawns one Pi RPC process per invocation and sends JSONL `get_state`, `get_available_models`, optional `set_model`, optional `set_thinking_level`, and `prompt` commands.\n- Waits for terminal `agent_end`, extracts final assistant text, emits VIDA-compatible result JSON only on stdout.\n- Errors emit parseable VIDA-compatible error JSON and nonzero exit.\n\nValidation passed:\n- `cargo fmt -p vida-pi-agent`\n- `cargo test -p vida-pi-agent` (2 unit tests + 5 adapter integration tests passed)\n- `git diff --check -- Cargo.toml crates/vida-pi-agent`\n- Manual fake-Pi smoke with `target/debug/vida-pi-agent.exe --pi-command target/debug/vida-pi-agent-fake-pi.exe --model openai-codex/gpt-5.5 --thinking-level low` returned success result JSON.\n\nNotes:\n- Tests use `vida-pi-agent-fake-pi`; no live Pi dependency.\n- `Cargo.lock` was not kept modified because the approved write scope excluded it. If the project later requires `--locked` validation for the new workspace member, authorize a lockfile update in the release/packaging slice.\n","labels":["agents","carrier","host-environment","pi","runtime"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"exclusive","order_bucket":"pi-wave-05-adapter","parallel_group":null,"conflict_domain":"pi-primary-environment"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":[],"acceptance_targets":[],"proof_targets":[],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-adapter-binary","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-internal-agent-projections","edge_type":"blocks","created_at":"1779203989071593100","created_by":"vida pi planning","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-adapter-binary","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-primary-environment","edge_type":"parent-child","created_at":"1779203966544252500","created_by":"vida task","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
{"id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-bounded-write-scope","display_id":null,"title":"Safety: bounded Pi write-scope guard","description":"Implement bounded write-scope guard for Pi write profiles. Writable paths come only from packet owned_paths; read/review profiles cannot write; symlink, absolute, and ../ escapes are denied.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"delivery_task","created_at":"1779203974899749400","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779209707703852700","closed_at":"1779209691858900000","close_reason":"Validation-only Pi bounded write-scope guard implemented and proven; full write admission remains fail-closed pending pre-write Pi extension/tool guard.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"Implemented validation-only Pi bounded write-scope guard for `vida-pi-agent`; full Pi write profiles remain runtime fail-closed until a pre-write Pi tool/extension guard exists.\n\nSafety decision:\n- Adapter guard is post-execution validation/evidence only (`pre_write_enforcement=false`). It does not make `guard_required_owned_paths` implementation profiles admissible.\n- Runtime selection fail-closed behavior remains proven by `guard_required_write_scope_is_rejected_for_implementation_until_guard_is_active`.\n\nChanged behavior:\n- `vida-pi-agent` supports `--scope-guard-mode` (`auto`, `off`, `validate-only`, `guarded-write`) and repeated `--owned-path` inputs.\n- Guard owned paths can also come from `VIDA_PI_AGENT_OWNED_PATHS` or `VIDA_DISPATCH_PACKET_PATH` packet `owned_paths`.\n- Project/workdir root and owned/touched paths are canonicalized.\n- Empty owned paths fail before provider launch in guarded write mode.\n- Absolute paths, `.`/`..` escapes, and symlink escapes outside project/owned scope are rejected.\n- Provider final-message JSON `touched_paths` / `changed_files` are validated as a subset of owned paths when guard data is available.\n- Scope violations emit parseable VIDA error JSON and nonzero exit.\n- Normalized success/error payloads include `scope_guard` metadata where applicable.\n- Runtime external provider parsing treats `scope_guard.valid=false` / violation statuses as blocked and preserves `provider_scope_guard` / `provider_reported_paths` in dispatch result JSON.\n\nProof:\n- `cargo test -p vida-pi-agent` PASS (7 lib + 9 adapter integration + doc tests).\n- `cargo test -p vida parse_external_provider_output -- --nocapture` PASS (10 focused parser tests).\n- `cargo test -p vida guard_required_write_scope_is_rejected_for_implementation_until_guard_is_active -- --nocapture` PASS.\n- `git diff --check` PASS.\n\nResidual blocker:\n- Full pre-write Pi write enforcement still requires Pi tool/extension integration; until then write-capable Pi implementation profiles must remain fail-closed.","labels":["agents","carrier","host-environment","pi","runtime"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"exclusive","order_bucket":"pi-wave-09-safety","parallel_group":null,"conflict_domain":"pi-primary-environment"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":[],"acceptance_targets":[],"proof_targets":[],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-bounded-write-scope","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-receipt-backed-dispatch","edge_type":"blocks","created_at":"1779203997908679200","created_by":"vida pi planning","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-bounded-write-scope","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-primary-environment","edge_type":"parent-child","created_at":"1779203974899749400","created_by":"vida task","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
