{"id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-internal-agent-projections","display_id":null,"title":"Internal agents: Pi projections for VIDA roles/carriers","description":"Implement Pi internal-agent support as VIDA projections into .pi/settings.json, .pi/agents/*.md, and optional .pi/chains/*.chain.md. Canonical execution remains vida agent-init and VIDA receipts.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"delivery_task","created_at":"1779203964214918300","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779206782978648600","closed_at":"1779206782978648600","close_reason":"Pi internal-agent projections enriched with explicit metadata, model-profile boundaries, chain runbook, and targeted proof.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"Completed Pi internal-agent projection slice.\n\nDecision:\n- Existing Pi host materialization already created baseline `.pi/settings.json`, `.pi/agents/<carrier>.md`, and `.pi/chains/` projection outputs, but it did not yet expose explicit internal-agent projection metadata, Pi model-profile boundaries, or a chain/runbook file. A small bounded enhancement was required.\n\nChanged files:\n- `crates/vida/src/project_activator_host_cli_materialization.rs`\n- `crates/vida/src/project_activator_surface.rs` tests\n\nImplemented:\n- `.pi/settings.json` now includes `internal_agent_projection` metadata with projection kind, generated formats, VIDA authority, canonical execution surface, completion evidence requirement, and no-recursion/no-self-dispatch/no-closure markers.\n- `.pi/settings.json` includes `model_profiles` copied from `agent_system.subagents.pi_cli.model_profiles` so Pi-local projections show VIDA-selected profile boundaries without becoming authority.\n- `.pi/agents/<carrier>.md` now includes explicit `internal_agent_projection: true`, `canonical_execution_surface: vida agent-init`, carrier/runtime-role boundaries, and model-profile selection boundary text.\n- `.pi/chains/vida-agent-init.chain.md` is g