{"id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-prewrite-tool-guard","display_id":null,"title":"Feature: Pi pre-write tool guard for owned paths","description":"Implement a real pre-write Pi tool/extension guard so write-capable pi_cli profiles can be admitted only when Pi writes are constrained to VIDA dispatch packet owned_paths before mutation. Must preserve one-shot Pi process/session semantics, no unrestricted writes, no recursion/self-dispatch, and dynamic VIDA model/profile selection.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"delivery_task","created_at":"1779211882266542300","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779212737138482300","closed_at":"1779212737138482300","close_reason":"Pi pre-write tool/extension guard implemented and proven; guarded write profiles are admissible only when adapter pre-write enforcement is active.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"Implemented Pi pre-write guarded-write path. vida-pi-agent now reports capabilities, fails guarded-write when extensions are disabled, writes an adapter-owned TypeScript guard extension, launches Pi with explicit --extension, supplies VIDA_PI_AGENT_SCOPE_GUARD_MODE, VIDA_PI_AGENT_PROJECT_ROOT, VIDA_PI_AGENT_OWNED_PATHS_JSON, and keeps post-execution touched-path validation. The extension blocks write/edit outside owned paths, blocks bash/user_bash to prevent shell write bypass, and blocks unknown mutating tool names. Runtime dispatch injects guarded-write mode for guard_required_owned_paths profiles, readiness probes adapter capabilities, and assignment admits guarded Pi write profiles only when write_scope_guard.status is active with pre_write_enforcement true. Validation passed: cargo test -p vida-pi-agent; cargo test -p vida guard_required_write_scope -- --nocapture; cargo test -p vida adapter_prewrite_guard_capabilities_reports_test_fixture_active -- --exact --nocapture; cargo test -p vida configured_external_activation_parts_injects_pi_model_and_thinking_level -- --exact --nocapture; cargo run -p vida-pi-agent --bin vida-pi-agent -- --capabilities-json; docflow checks for Pi docs; git diff --check.","labels":["carrier","pi","runtime","write-scope"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"exclusive","order_bucket":null,"parallel_group":null,"conflict_domain":"pi-primary-environment"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":[],"acceptance_targets":[],"proof_targets":[],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-prewrite-tool-guard","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-primary-environment","edge_type":"parent-child","created_at":"1779211882266542300","created_by":"vida task","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
