{"id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-readiness-preflight","display_id":null,"title":"Readiness: Pi command/auth/model/profile preflight","description":"Add Pi readiness for command discovery, adapter version, auth, model availability, thinking level support, and route-primary blocked backend reporting. vida status --json reports blockers/next actions truthfully.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"delivery_task","created_at":"1779203970945490700","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779208424030758100","closed_at":"1779208424030758100","close_reason":"Pi readiness/preflight implemented with adapter/provider/model catalog/write guard blockers and focused proof.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"Implemented Pi readiness/preflight interpretation in `status_surface_external_cli.rs`.\n\nBehavior added:\n- Nested Pi-style readiness is detected from `readiness.adapter`, `readiness.provider`, `readiness.model_catalog`, or `readiness.write_scope_guard`.\n- Adapter command is checked from `readiness.adapter.command` and reports distinct `pi_adapter_command_not_found` / `pi_adapter_command_not_configured` statuses.\n- Provider command is checked from `readiness.provider.command` and reports distinct `pi_provider_command_not_found` / `pi_provider_command_not_configured` statuses.\n- Dispatch command remains `vida-pi-agent`; raw `pi` is checked only as provider command for model catalog/readiness.\n- Pi model catalog mode (`pi_rpc_get_available_models` / equivalent aliases) runs a short bounded `--list-models` probe and verifies the selected profile model is present.\n- Missing model blocks with `pi_model_unavailable` and blocker `model_not_pinned`; probe failure blocks with `pi_model_catalog_unavailable`.\n- Guard-required write profiles block with `pi_write_scope_guard_required` until a future write-scope guard task activates evidence.\n- Read-only/no-write profiles do not block solely on write-scope guard.\n- Readiness output now includes `adapter`, `provider`, `model_catalog`, and `write_scope_guard` machine-readable fields.\n\nValidation:\n- `cargo check -p vida` passed (warnings only).\n- Existing external CLI readiness exact tests passed:\n  - `external_cli_detect_command_missing_blocks_carrier_readiness`\n  - `external_cli_detect_command_present_preserves_ready_status`\n  - `external_cli_dispatch_command_is_authoritative_probe_when_present`\n  - `external_cli_preflight_reports_ready_with_override_for_model_drift`\n  - `external_cli_readiness_can_be_pinned_to_preferred_profile`\n- New Pi readiness tests passed individually:\n  - `pi_readiness_blocks_when_adapter_command_missing_distinctly`\n  - `pi_readiness_blocks_when_provider_command_missing_after_adapter_found`\n  - `pi_readiness_reports_model_catalog_ready_for_readonly_profile`\n  - `pi_readiness_blocks_when_model_catalog_is_missing_selected_model`\n  - `pi_readiness_blocks_guarded_write_profile_until_write_guard_exists`\n  - `pi_readiness_does_not_block_readonly_profile_on_write_guard`\n- Direct grouped unit-test binary run for `pi_readiness` passed 6/6.\n- Runtime smoke with `target/debug` on PATH:\n  - `target/debug/vida.exe status --json` contains `pi_cli` readiness row with adapter/provider `command_found`, model catalog `model_available`, and write guard `guard_required_not_active` for guarded profile.\n  - `target/debug/vida.exe agent select --runtime-role worker --task-class implementation --json` rejects guarded Pi write profiles due `pi_write_scope_guard_required`/write-scope inadmissibility while retaining internal fallback selection.\n- `git diff --check -- crates/vida/src/status_surface_external_cli.rs` passed.\n\nResidual:\n- Write-capable Pi profile admission remains intentionally blocked until `feature-vida-pi-agent-bounded-write-scope` implements active guard evidence.\n- Release packaging/install of `vida-pi-agent` remains a later task.\n","labels":["agents","carrier","host-environment","pi","runtime"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"exclusive","order_bucket":"pi-wave-07-readiness","parallel_group":null,"conflict_domain":"pi-primary-environment"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":[],"acceptance_targets":[],"proof_targets":[],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-readiness-preflight","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-carrier-runtime-selection","edge_type":"blocks","created_at":"1779203994052107300","created_by":"vida pi planning","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-readiness-preflight","depends_on_id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-primary-environment","edge_type":"parent-child","created_at":"1779203970945490700","created_by":"vida task","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
