{"id":"feature-vida-pi-agent-smoke-and-ci","display_id":null,"title":"Verification: Pi smoke tests and CI proof matrix","description":"Add smoke/CI coverage for config projection, readiness, selection, adapter execution, bounded write scope, installer, and optional live Pi probe in external-cli-carrier smoke.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"verification","created_at":"1779203978713584200","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779210881340714700","closed_at":"1779210816382549900","close_reason":"Pi smoke/CI proof matrix implemented and validated: optional/skippable carrier smoke, Pi adapter help, fake Pi RPC smoke, opt-in live Pi smoke, CI Pi-only fake smoke, and TaskFlow proof notes recorded.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"Completed Pi smoke/CI slice.\n\nSmoke modes added:\n- scripts/external-cli-carrier-smoke.sh now treats external CLIs as optional/skipped when missing instead of failing on absent commands.\n- Pi adapter help smoke runs whenever vida-pi-agent is found on PATH or target/debug|target/release.\n- Fake Pi RPC smoke runs when vida-pi-agent-fake-pi is available, validating VIDA result JSON without live provider credentials.\n- Live Pi RPC smoke remains explicit opt-in via VIDA_PI_LIVE_SMOKE=1.\n- VIDA_EXTERNAL_CLI_SMOKE_ONLY_PI=1 gives CI/local proof a Pi-only mode that avoids accidental credentialed legacy-carrier calls.\n\nCI additions:\n- validate job builds vida-pi-agent bins, checks script syntax, and runs Pi-only fake smoke from target/debug.\n- Existing release/installer CI assertions already prove packaged/installed vida-pi-agent --help on Unix and Windows.\n\nPrior slice proof notes retained without heavy output:\n- Config/template projection: Pi profiles and host_environment.systems.pi added in vida.config.yaml and canonical template; project materialization renders .pi/settings.json, .pi/agents/pi-primary.md, and .pi/chains/.\n- Readiness: pi_cli readiness checks adapter