{"id":"github-114-post-commit-runtime-diagnostics","display_id":null,"title":"GitHub #114: Post-commit runtime diagnostics reconciliation","description":"Source: https://github.com/pomazanbohdan/vida-stack/issues/114. Build or document a deterministic post-commit diagnostic surface that reconciles TaskFlow, DocFlow, run-graph recovery, continuation binding, root write guard, and host dispatch/model compatibility. Acceptance source: issue #114 body. Proposed first implementation unit: normalize post-commit diagnostic output and issue recommendation fields without duplicating existing status surfaces.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"1778062140267082500","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779310276793886800","closed_at":"1779310276793886800","close_reason":"current-binary-rungraph-closure-revalidation-pass","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"2026-05-06 GitHub intake/run-graph evidence: seeded #114 from GitHub issue; dispatch-init produced packet .vida/data/state/runtime-consumption/dispatch-packets/github-114-post-commit-runtime-diagnostics-2026-05-06T10-10-26.6167848Z.json and receipt selected business_analyst/middle. Executing vida agent-init --dispatch-packet <packet> --execute-dispatch --json failed with runtime_assignment_unavailable. Run-graph status is blocked at active_node=specification with blockers pending_specification_evidence, pending_design_finalize, pending_spec_task_close. This is evidence for #114 host-dispatch/preflight reconciliation and not delegated completion.\r\n\r\n2026-05-06 GitHub comment ingestion: read all current comments via gh issue view --comments. #114 has 11 comments. Added sub-scope evidence categories: downstream dispatch packet delivery_task_packet missing owned_paths during lane complete; status/recovery/taskflow continuation contradictions; recovery recommending bind to task ids missing from TaskFlow state; exception takeover remaining act