{"id":"pr-protocol-actions-ci-checks-20260522","display_id":null,"title":"Add PR Actions/checks gate to PR processing protocol","description":"Update PR processing protocol so each PR includes GitHub Actions/checks inspection, failure triage, fix when feasible, and rerun/proof evidence before merge or closure.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"1779427867431700900","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779427920662086800","closed_at":"1779427920662086800","close_reason":"PR protocol updated: Actions/checks inspection, failure triage, fix/rerun evidence, and merge/close gating are now required in AGENTS.sidecar.md rule 22f.","source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"2026-05-22 process update evidence.\n\nSource: user correction during PR processing.\nSpec/protocol consulted: AGENTS.sidecar.md rules 22e-22k and GitHub PR protocol.\n\nChange:\n- Updated AGENTS.sidecar.md rule 22f so PR processing must inspect GitHub Actions/checks for the PR head and expected post-merge target when accessible.\n- PR TaskFlow notes must record check status, failing-check log or summary evidence, failure classification, fix/rerun evidence, and merge/close decision.\n- Failing required or relevant checks become bounded CI-failure work linked to the PR.\n- When a check failure is in-scope and feasible, it must be fixed before accepting the PR.\n- Closing without fixing requires an explicit recorded reason and GitHub comment.\n\nNext:\n- Resume PR #231 and include Actions/checks inspection in the PR evidence before merge/close.\n","labels":["ci","process_update","pull_request"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"sequential","order_bucket":null,"parallel_group":null,"conflict_domain":"github-pr-protocol"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":["AGENTS.sidecar.md"],"acceptance_targets":["PR protocol requires Actions/checks evidence before merge/close"],"proof_targets":["AGENTS.sidecar.md updated and current PR pr