{"id":"update-sidecar-qwen-fallback-research-mode","display_id":null,"title":"Document qwen fallback research mode in AGENTS sidecar","description":"Add project-local AGENTS.sidecar.md rules for using Pi worker/delegate qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp as bounded fresh-context async read-only fallback research carrier with <=5 read/search/list operations per child, no write authority transfer, and canonical VIDA/TaskFlow agent-init preserved for write-producing work.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"1779270013111511000","created_by":"vida task","updated_at":"1779271773768876000","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"source_repo":"C:\\project\\vida-stack","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"notes":"2026-05-20 qwen fallback research operating mode evidence and saved configuration:\n\nSaved user-level Pi configuration/documentation:\n- `C:\\Users\\pomaz\\.pi\\agent\\settings.json`: builtin `delegate` override uses `qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp` and `defaultContext=fresh`.\n- `C:\\Users\\pomaz\\.pi\\agent\\extensions\\subagent\\config.json`: `parallel.maxTasks=4`, `parallel.concurrency=4`.\n- `C:\\Users\\pomaz\\.pi\\agent\\agents\\qwen-research.md`: custom read-only qwen research agent with no shell, no edits, no subagents, fresh context, qwen model.\n- `C:\\Users\\pomaz\\.pi\\agent\\docs\\qwen-fallback-research-mode.md`: user-level operating documentation for VIDA/Pi qwen fallback research mode.\n- `C:\\Users\\pomaz\\.pi\\agent\\docs\\vida-agents-sidecar-qwen-fallback-pending-patch.md`: exact pending `AGENTS.sidecar.md` patch text for bootstrap-visible project documentation when lawful.\n\nRegistry verification:\n- `subagent({ action: \"list\", agentScope: \"user\" })` shows `qwen-research (user, context: fresh)`.\n- builtin `delegate` appears as context:fresh through override.\n\nOperational mode for VIDA work:\n- Qwen fallback agents are read-only research/context/review support only.\n- For code-producing requests, qwen may provide a junior draft or implementation sketch only; actual project mutation remains parent/VIDA-owned.\n- They do not replace canonical VIDA/TaskFlow `vida agent-init` write-producing delegation.\n- They never receive write authority for project files, `.vida/data/state`, receipts, packets, lane metadata, or release artifacts.\n- Parent/orchestrator synthesizes their artifacts and routes any implementation/doc changes through VIDA bounded units.\n\nRecommended launch shapes:\n```ts\nsubagent({\n  agent: \"delegate\",\n  task: \"Bounded read-only research slice with required markdown output schema...\",\n  async: true,\n  context: \"fresh\",\n  model: \"qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp\",\n  reads: false,\n  progress: false,\n  output: \"tmp/qwen-<slice>.md\",\n  outputMode: \"file-only\"\n})\n```\n\n```ts\nsubagent({\n  agent: \"qwen-research\",\n  task: \"Bounded read-only research slice with required markdown output schema...\",\n  async: true,\n  context: \"fresh\",\n  output: \"tmp/qwen-<slice>.md\",\n  outputMode: \"file-only\"\n})\n```\n\nConcurrency policy after tests:\n- Preferred execution shape: independent single async qwen delegate/research runs, not grouped `tasks:[...]` for now.\n- Conservative mode: 3 active independent lanes.\n- Aggressive rolling mode: max 4 active independent lanes; open a new lane when one finishes, up to the planned total.\n- 12-run rolling stress result with max 4 active: all 12 completed process-wise; 10/12 produced non-empty artifacts; 2/12 produced 0 B artifacts.\n- Treat 0 B output as content failure, not process failure; retry that slice with a concrete mini-analysis prompt and required markdown sections.\n\nProject docs status:\n- Planned `AGENTS.sidecar.md` section is still pending because current VIDA lane/write guard allows root-local write only for `crates/vida/src/doctor_surface.rs`, not `AGENTS.sidecar.md`.\n- Exact pending patch text is saved at `C:\\Users\\pomaz\\.pi\\agent\\docs\\vida-agents-sidecar-qwen-fallback-pending-patch.md`.\n- When lawful, apply that patch to make the mode visible during new-session bootstrap.\n","labels":["agents","fallback","research","sidecar"],"execution_semantics":{"execution_mode":"exclusive","order_bucket":"docs-sidecar","parallel_group":null,"conflict_domain":"AGENTS.sidecar.md"},"planner_metadata":{"owned_paths":[],"acceptance_targets":[],"proof_targets":[],"risk":null,"estimate":null,"lane_hint":null},"dependencies":[]}
